WEBVTT

00:04:59.788 --> 00:05:01.788
to a single person,

00:05:01.788 --> 00:05:04.788
‘you’ to one instead of ‘thou,’

00:05:04.788 --> 00:05:10.204
contrary to the pure, plain
and single language of truth,

00:05:10.246 --> 00:05:13.621
‘thou’ to one and ‘you’ to more than one.”

00:05:13.954 --> 00:05:16.038
And he goes on.

00:05:16.496 --> 00:05:17.704
Needless to say,

00:05:17.704 --> 00:05:21.371
this change in pronouns
was a big deal in the 1600s.

00:05:22.329 --> 00:05:26.288
But actually, if you followed the debates
about the singular they at all,

00:05:26.329 --> 00:05:28.954
these arguments
might sound familiar to you.

00:05:29.413 --> 00:05:32.163
They're not that far off
from the bickering we hear